name: sim.getCollectionName
description: 
luaSynopsis: string collectionName=sim.getCollectionName(int collectionHandle)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. collectionHandle: handle of the collection
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. pointer to the name of the collection or nullptr if an error occurred. The user is in charge of destroying the returned buffer with simReleaseBuffer
